    "body": "## Summary\n\nReverts #200 (`box-sizing: border-box`, ADR-039 Commit 2). **Visual regression found in the merged render**: gray strip on the left, search icon shifted. **The commit merged without rendering and inspecting the PNG first** — process failure, not just code issue.\n\n## What went wrong\n\nCommit 2 shipped with the two-commit risk isolation strategy (ADR-039's design). The commit message honestly flagged it as \"risk-isolated for easy revert.\" But the commit was pushed and merged **without opening `/tmp/wiki-adr039-c2.png`** — the render that would have shown the regression immediately.\n\nThe PNG shows:\n- **Gray strip at x≈0-110, full height** (was not there in Commit 1)\n- Search icon shifted from x=386 to x=438\n- Article body otherwise appears reasonable\n\nTotal layout height unchanged (~62283), so the regression is dimensional not structural — some element's box-sizing-aware width shifted and left a gap or revealed a background.\n\n## What's reverted\n\nJust `a073031` — Commit 2 alone. Commit 1 (`height`, `min/max` clamps, `overflow: hidden`) stays on main, and its verified visual state is preserved:\n\n- Search icon **20×20** visible in header (ADR-037's height gap stays closed)\n- Layout height **62283** (no collapse)\n- Article title at y=128 (sane)\n- No gray strip\n\n**The two-commit split worked as designed.** Commit 2 is isolated; revert doesn't touch Commit 1's verified fix.\n\n## What's next\n\n`box-sizing: border-box` will be re-attempted with proper verification discipline:\n1. Render before/after PNG **before committing**\n2. Compare visually, identify each changed element\n3. Only merge if PNG is sane\n4. Document the specific first-viewport delta with measurements\n\nThe root cause of the current regression (which element's box-sizing-aware width created the gray strip) is **unmeasured** — deferred to the re-attempt's diagnostic phase.\n\n## Test count\n\nRevert is docs + code rollback only. Test count returns to Commit 1 state:\n- 494 cases / 1881 assertions (was 500 / 1894 with Commit 2)\n\n## Verification\n\n| Check | Expected |\n|---|---|\n| Revert builds clean | |\n| Full suite returns to 494 / 1881 | |\n| Render matches Commit 1 PNG | |\n| Search icon 20×20 | |\n| No gray strip | |\n\nRefs #198 #200\n",
